done: [2026-07-31 late] Post-release backlog grilled + re-scoped (ledger: internal/BRAINSTORM-backlog-actions-2026-07-31.md, local-only per .gitignore BRAINSTORM-* convention — 7 grill decisions). Executed: #41 REWRITTEN (wrong premise corrected — real gaps: no compute_truth passthrough in medsim_run_chunk, non-atomic cache saveRDS at cache.R:82-86, config.R:28-30 seed doc error); #28 re-scoped docs-only (Gate B shipped; vignette + array_throttle in ?medsim_config; [ -s ] gate noted withdrawn); #29 re-scoped to 6-field factory on the REAL RMediation 1.6.1 API ci(ProductNormal3(mu, Sigma, method="hcubature")) — old medci(type="prod3") was fabricated; rmediation#18 CLOSED as shipped; #35 SPLIT — upstream BCa request filed as probmed#32 (ward_residual se_method is match.arg analytic/bootstrap, no passthrough), #35 now the medsim doc/tracking stub (corrected cites methods_gauge.R:51,:61-63); NEW #43 filed: parallel=TRUE silently DROPS replications whose errors escape the method tryCatch (medsim_error objects fail .medsim_rbind_reps' nrow filter, runner.R:749 — empirically confirmed; this is what masks the v0.5.0 numeric-kind reserved-error regression under parallel). Release vehicle decision: ride dev, NO 0.5.1 patch (r-universe publishes dev). est_error rename fix running in separate session (task_bac224eb) — pending verify-and-absorb on landing. #43 FIX DESIGN COMPLETE — canonical doc `internal/GRILL-medsim-43-parallel-fail-loud-2026-07-31.md` (83f44fa; 19 decisions over 4 grill rounds + 2 adversarial reviews, both AMEND-FIRST, 35 findings/26 confirmed). NOT started; delivery = two PRs: PR-A combine gates (schema-vote fix + partial_chunk + MANDATORY new dgp_failure violation — without it the fix silences rep_gap, measured 1→0, i.e. net detection regression) is UNBLOCKED and lands first; PR-B (runner condition + chunk write + split accounting) waits on task_bac224eb (same runner.R region). Do not re-derive the design from this file or the issue body — both are pointers now. Open: #28 #29 #35(blocked-upstream) #41 #43 + probmed#32. task_bac224eb LANDED (987d176, worktree ~/.git-worktrees/medsim/pensive-goodall-3e2dfb, no PR — which is why no notification fired; poll git refs for spawned-session work, don't wait to be told). Reviewed → FIX-FIRST: rename clean (suite 1123/0/0/1 vs 1117 baseline, verified independently; leak-scan clean; merges cleanly), but 3 blocking items — plain stop() discards completed reps (15 of 20 lost in A/B), the "parallel path" test sets n_cores=1 and never reaches it, _pkgdown.yml:129 still documents `error`. Session reports: .remember/session-reports/session-report-2026-07-31{,-evening}.html (morning + evening; evening also synced to Obsidian Research/20_projects/medsim/). [2026-07-31 night] v0.5.0 RELEASED. Release PR #42 (dev→main, merge commit, 7/7 CI green incl. windows verified on exact head sha) → tag v0.5.0 (ae83888) → GitHub release (Hopper caveat noted in notes) → main pkgdown deployed (root site 0.5.0, CLAUDE.html still 404) → dev bumped 0.5.0.9000 (b724521). Release gates: suite 1117/0/0/1, as-cran 0/0/1-baseline (dev-suffix NOTE gone at clean 0.5.0; AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md added to .Rbuildignore killing the working-dir NOTE). r-universe lag monitor armed (dev-pinned; poll: curl -s https://data-wise.r-universe.dev/api/packages/medsim). Remaining open: #28 #29 #35 #41 — all post-release features/docs/perf. [2026-07-31 pm] #34 grilled + 3 bugs filed. Interactive /craft:grill of the #34 spec (internal/GRILL-medsim-chunked-run-gates-2026-07-31.md, ead5862): 9 branches (B1–B9) — on_violation stop-with-data-carrying-condition, A.2 configurable thresholds + auto column selection over continuous estimate_cols (named default "estimate" matches NO real column), A.1 self-validating contiguity (no external nsim), D pilot-identity assert before value-match, C SHA auto-detect, B login-shell shebang + write-time output path. Empirical verification then filed: #36 (chunked runs collide replication ids; medsim_analyze reports chunk size 5 as n_replications for nsim=20 — reproduced; fix = persist global_rep_id + metadata_cols registration, is #34's prerequisite), #37 (generated submit template plain #!/bin/bash → module: command not found on Hopper; repo's own inst/hopper-tests script documents -l required — confirmed), #38 (bonus find: chunks overwrite each other's intermediate results_scenario_N.csv, index-only key, same class as #27; .rds combine unaffected — reproduced 4 chunks → 1 csv). Review returned: 26 findings (19 CONFIRMED, 7 empirical) → spec v2 (dd1c318) locked single-global-replication architecture + R1–R10 amendments. #34 SPEC FULLY IMPLEMENTED on branch feature/chunked-run-prereqs (dde3692 → 8797740, pushed; base dev@dd1c318): P1–P3 (global replication ids/schema v2, combine metadata rebuild, failure-row schema — fixes #36+#38+2 crashers) + Gate A (seed-provenance audit, data-carrying medsim_combine_violation, medsim_audit_results() export) + Gate B (hardened login-shell template — fixes #37; exemplar swept) + Gates C+D (provenance header w/ auto-SHA + single-SHA assert; pilot-subset control, identity-first). Full suite in-tree 1077 PASS / 0 FAIL / 1 SKIP; --as-cran 0/0/1-known-NOTE (also fixed the .rforge.yaml/.flow hidden-file NOTE from today via .Rbuildignore). BREAKING: expected_chunks/missing-chunk handling now stop-by-default (interim looks: on_violation="warn"). Doc sync done via 3 parallel agents (vignette audit section, _pkgdown.yml index, cross-refs). MERGED 2026-07-31 evening: PR #39 (chunked-run integrity — P1–P3 + Gates A–D + review hardening; squash 94ec11c) and PR #40 (quality round — closed-form pmed truth, validation/table/docs fixes, bit-identity dedup; squash 5fe9ae4), both squash to dev, both leak-scanned, both adversarially reviewed pre-merge (each returned FIX FIRST once, all blockers fixed + re-verified). dev suite post-merge: 1117 PASS / 0 FAIL / 0 ERR / 1 SKIP; --as-cran 0/0/1-baseline-NOTE. Issues CLOSED: #34 #36 #37 #38 (manual — dev-merge doesn't auto-close). Worktrees removed; remote feature branches deleted; local feature/{chunked-run-prereqs,quality-fixes} refs remain (squash-merge -d false positive — need user -D, tips verified == PR heads). Follow-ups filed: #41 (E4 truth-recompute race + X1 config$seed doc, deferred from review). NOTE: dev now has a BREAKING change vs 0.4.0 (expected_chunks stop-by-default) — next release is a version-bump decision (0.5.0). Note: medsim_run_chunk() has no compute_truth passthrough (unfiled, possibly by-design). [2026-07-31] Issue triage + #34 spec. Closed 3 stale-open issues after verifying against dev: #24 gauge estimand (exported/documented/tested), #25 ADEMP gates (PR #26), #27 truth-cache collision (fixed by .medsim_truth_fingerprint guard PR #31 + green regression test). Adversarial re-review of the 3 closures: #25/#27 SOUND; #24 PARTIAL — BCa CI arm (gate-A3) + ci=/se_method= interface from the issue's Ask were never delivered though closed as "fully shipped" → filed follow-up #35 (not reopened; headline analytic-vs-percentile grid is served). Drafted+committed internal/SPEC-medsim-chunked-run-gates-2026-07-31.md (#34, f59b922) with grill ledger G1–G9; grill spine finding: global_rep_id computed for seeding only, never persisted (runner.R:402 stores local rep_id) → #34-A/#34-D need a prerequisite column, which also fixes an n_replications under-count for combined chunk runs (analyze.R:236). #34 Part B subsumes unshipped #28B — cross-linked #34↔#28. Added .flow/obsidian-sync.yml (savant report/session delivery). Open issues now: #28, #29, #34 (spec'd), #35. [2026-07-31] pkgdown internal-doc leak closed — CLAUDE.md was being published as live CLAUDE.html (pkgdown renders every root .md). Untracked + gitignored CLAUDE.md & AGENTS.md (kept on disk for agents), filed .rforge.yaml with site.allowlist (vignettes/.gitignore false positive) — commit 277c2f8. Purged live gh-pages/CLAUDE.html (404 confirmed); index.html still 200. Only root CLAUDE.html was ever deployed (other scratch htmls were local-build-only). Won't recur: files not in committed tree, so neither CI nor clean-ref deploy rebuilds them. #30 fix(run_chunk): deterministic per-replication seeding via .medsim_det_seed(), independent of chunk/worker/cluster-type/order — fixes SLURM chunk-collapse (coverage pinned at 1.0). #31 two-tier test infra: Tier-A CRAN guards + Tier-B Hopper suite (12,000 reps @ production scale: nominal coverage 0.947, narrow-interval 0.480, 12,000/12,000 distinct seeds, FORK-reproducible — all PASS), surfaced 5 more latent fixes. dev is CRAN-clean: R CMD check --as-cran 0/0/0 (real notes only — .remember/ note is a local-only artifact, absent on clean CI checkout), devtools::test() 968/0/1. #25 ADEMP coverage gates MERGED to dev 2026-06-22 (PR #26; coverage MCSE + failed-run logging + performance table + nsim helper + SE-vs-estimate plot; 913/0, CI green all platforms). Also fixed a pre-existing dev pkgdown failure (Sobol index gap from #22) + CLAUDE.md Remotes drift (medfit→medrobust). v0.3.1 RELEASED 2026-06-19.
